{
  "key": 18871,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_DawnDialgaOrPalkiaAtSpearPillar",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\n",
        "The professor told me something.\r",
        "It’s possible that either DIALGA or\n",
        "PALKIA will appear at the Spear Pillar!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Le professeur m’a dit une chose.\r",
        "Il pense que DIALGA ou PALKIA va\n",
        "apparaître aux Colonnes Lances..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_DawnElderHasSomethingToTell",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "You’re friends with the elder of\n",
        "Celestic Town, aren’t you?\r",
        "She told me that she had something\n",
        "important to tell you."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Bonjour, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Tu es ami avec la doyenne de Célestia,\n",
        "n’est-ce pas?\r",
        "Elle m’a dit qu’elle avait quelque chose\n",
        "d’important à te dire."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_DawnSeenEverySinnohPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "May I see your Pokédex?\r",
        "...\r",
        "Oh, my gosh! You’ve seen every kind\n",
        "of Pokémon in Sinnoh!\r",
        "Hey, let’s go show your Pokédex to\n",
        "Prof. Rowan!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Bonjour, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Je peux voir ton Pokédex?\r",
        "...\r",
        "Oh, incroyable! Tu as vu toutes les\n",
        "espèces de Pokémon de Sinnoh!\r",
        "Hé, si on allait montrer ton Pokédex\n",
        "au Professeur Sorbier?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_DawnHaveYouChattedWithMySister",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, have you\n",
        "ever chatted with my kid sister?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, as-tu déjà\n",
        "discuté avec ma petite sœur?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_DawnAreYouAcquaintedWithBebe",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, are you\n",
        "acquainted with Bebe?\r",
        "She lives in Hearthome City.\r",
        "Every Trainer should make it a point\n",
        "to pay Bebe a visit.\r",
        "She’s the administrator of the Pokémon\n",
        "Storage System.\r",
        "She’s awesome!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, as-tu déjà\n",
        "rencontré Amelle?\r",
        "Elle vit à Unionpolis.\r",
        "Tous les Dresseurs devraient aller\n",
        "lui rendre visite.\r",
        "Elle a beaucoup travaillé au système\n",
        "de Gestion de Stocks de Pokémon.\r",
        "Elle est vraiment géniale!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_DawnIllShowUsePokeRadar",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Hey! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you’ve got\n",
        "a Poké Radar?\r",
        "I’ve got one, too!\r",
        "I’ll show you how to use it.\n",
        "Come with me to Rt. 202!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Hé! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, tu as un\n",
        "Poké Radar, n’est-ce pas?\r",
        "J’en ai un moi aussi.\r",
        "Je vais te montrer comment ça marche.\n",
        "Viens avec moi sur la Route 202!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_DawnHowsYourPokeRadar",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "How’s your Poké Radar?\r",
        "When you use it, do you sometimes\n",
        "see more than one patch of tall\f",
        "grass rustling?\r",
        "I’ve heard that patches farther away\n",
        "give you a better chance of seeing\f",
        "the same kind of Pokémon in a row."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Bonjour, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Tu te sers de ton Poké Radar?\r",
        "Quand tu l’utilises, vois-tu parfois\n",
        "plusieurs endroits dans les hautes\f",
        "herbes qui remuent en même temps?\r",
        "L’endroit le plus éloigné augmente tes\n",
        "chances de voir le même type de\f",
        "Pokémon plusieurs fois d’affilée."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_DawnSometimesPatchOfGrassSparkles",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Sometimes a patch of grass\n",
        "sparkles when a Poké Radar is used.\r",
        "People say a different-colored\n",
        "Pokémon is hiding there!\r",
        "Could that be true?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Parfois, une touffe d’herbe\n",
        "brille quand on utilise le Poké Radar.\r",
        "On dit que c’est parce qu’un Pokémon de\n",
        "couleur différente s’y cache!\r",
        "Tu crois que c’est vrai?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_DawnHelpingWithNationalPokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: So, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "I’m also helping the professor put\n",
        "together the National Pokédex.\r",
        "Catching Pokémon can be really\n",
        "challenging, can’t it?\r",
        "But, it’s also so much fun!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "J’aide également le professeur à\n",
        "compléter le Pokédex National.\r",
        "Attraper des Pokémon peut être parfois\n",
        "assez difficile, n’est-ce pas?\r",
        "Mais c’est aussi tellement amusant!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_DawnCompletedNationalDex",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0},\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Congratulations for completing\n",
        "the National Pokédex!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0},\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Félicitations! Tu as complété le\n",
        "Pokédex National!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_DawnIsTodayYourBirthday",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Is today maybe...\n",
        "Your birthday, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Est-ce qu’aujourd’hui, c’est...\n",
        "ton anniversaire, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_DawnCongratulations",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Giggle...\n",
        "Congratulations, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\f",
        "And many more happy returns!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Hi, hi, hi...\n",
        "Joyeux anniversaire, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\f",
        "Et tous mes vœux de bonheur!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_DawnWhatMadeMeThinkBirthday",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Oh, it isn’t?\r",
        "I wonder what made me think that\n",
        "today was your birthday?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Ah, non?\r",
        "Je me demande pourquoi je pensais que\n",
        "ton anniversaire était aujourd’hui..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_DawnCongratulationsChamp",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "I heard from the professor!\r",
        "Congratulations, Champ!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Félicitations!\r",
        "Tu as été super!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_LucasDialgaOrPalkiaAtSpearPillar",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "The prof told me something cool.\r",
        "He thinks that either DIALGA or\n",
        "PALKIA will appear at the Spear Pillar!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Le prof m’a appris un truc cool.\r",
        "Il pense que DIALGA ou PALKIA va\n",
        "apparaître aux Colonnes Lances..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_LucasElderHasSomethingToTell",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "You know the elder of Celestic Town,\n",
        "right?\r",
        "She told me she had something\n",
        "to tell you."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Bonjour, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Tu connais la doyenne de Célestia,\n",
        "pas vrai?\r",
        "Elle m’a dit qu’elle avait quelque chose\n",
        "d’important à te dire."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_LucasSeenEverySinnohPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Let me take a look at your Pokédex.\r",
        "...\r",
        "Awesome! You’ve seen every kind\n",
        "of Pokémon in Sinnoh!\r",
        "You have to show this Pokédex to\n",
        "Prof. Rowan!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Laisse-moi jeter un œil à ton Pokédex.\r",
        "...\r",
        "Incroyable! Tu as vu toutes les\n",
        "espèces de Pokémon de Sinnoh!\r",
        "Il faut que tu montres ce Pokédex\n",
        "au Professeur Sorbier!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_LucasHaveYouSeenMySister",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, have you\n",
        "ever seen my kid sister?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, tu as déjà\n",
        "rencontré ma petite sœur?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_LucasHaveYouMetBebe",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, have you\n",
        "met Bebe?\r",
        "She lives out in Hearthome City.\r",
        "If you’re a Trainer, you owe it to\n",
        "yourself to visit her.\r",
        "After all, she’s the administrator of\n",
        "the Pokémon Storage System."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, tu as déjà\n",
        "rencontré Amelle?\r",
        "Elle vit à Unionpolis.\r",
        "Tous les Dresseurs doivent lui rendre\n",
        "visite au moins une fois.\r",
        "Elle a beaucoup travaillé au système de\n",
        "Gestion de Stocks de Pokémon, tu sais!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_LucasIllTeachUsePokeRadar",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hey! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you’ve got\n",
        "yourself a Poké Radar, too?\r",
        "Cool!\n",
        "I’ll teach you how to use it!\f",
        "Come out to Rt. 202!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Hé! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, tu as aussi\n",
        "obtenu un Poké Radar?\r",
        "Cool!\n",
        "Je vais te montrer comment t’en servir!\f",
        "Viens avec moi sur la Route 202!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_LucasHowsYourPokeRadar",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "How’s your Poké Radar working out?\r",
        "When you use it, do you sometimes\n",
        "see more than one patch of tall\f",
        "grass rustling?\r",
        "Did you notice that patches farther\n",
        "away give you a better chance\f",
        "of seeing the same kind of Pokémon\r",
        "in a row?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Salut, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Il marche bien, ce Poké Radar?\r",
        "Quand tu t’en sers, vois-tu parfois\n",
        "plusieurs zones d’herbe haute qui\f",
        "bougent en même temps?\r",
        "L’endroit le plus éloigné augmente tes\n",
        "chances de voir le même type de\f",
        "Pokémon plusieurs fois d’affilée.\r",
        "Tu avais remarqué?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_LucasSometimesPatchOfGrassSparkles",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Sometimes a patch of grass\n",
        "sparkles when a Poké Radar is used.\r",
        "They say a different-colored\n",
        "Pokémon is hiding there!\r",
        "I wonder if that’s true?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Parfois, une zone d’herbe brille\n",
        "quand le Poké Radar est utilisé.\r",
        "On dit qu’un Pokémon de couleur\n",
        "différente s’y cacherait!\r",
        "Je me demande si c’est vrai..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_LucasHelpingWithNationalPokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: So, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "I’m also helping the professor out\n",
        "with the National Pokédex.\r",
        "Catching Pokémon can be really\n",
        "challenging, can’t it?\r",
        "But I also have a ton of fun doing it!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Moi aussi, j’aide le professeur à\n",
        "compléter le Pokédex National.\r",
        "C’est difficile d’attraper des Pokémon,\n",
        "pas vrai?\r",
        "Mais c’est tellement marrant!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_LucasCompletedNationalDex",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Wow! I don’t know what to say!\n",
        "I mean, it’s so awesome and all...\r",
        "Sincerely, congratulations for\n",
        "completing the National Pokédex!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Oh là là! Je ne sais pas quoi dire!\n",
        "Enfin, c’est tellement incroyable...\r",
        "Sincèrement, toutes mes félicitations!\n",
        "Tu as complété le Pokédex National!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_LucasIsItYourBirthdayToday",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\n",
        "Is it maybe your birthday today?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "C’est ton anniversaire aujourd’hui?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_LucasCongratulations",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: I thought so!\n",
        "Congratulations, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\f",
        "You know, I’m glad we’re friends!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: C’est bien ce que je pensais!\n",
        "Joyeux anniv’, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Tu sais, je suis content qu’on soit\n",
        "amis!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_LucasWhatMadeMeThinkBirthday",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Huh?\n",
        "It isn’t?\r",
        "Now, what made me think it was\n",
        "your birthday? Freaky weird."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Hein?!\n",
        "C’est pas aujourd’hui?\r",
        "Mais pourquoi j’ai cru que c’était ton\n",
        "anniversaire? Trop bizarre."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_LucasCongratulationsChamp",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "The professor told me the news!\r",
        "Congratulations, Champ!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Félicitations!\r",
        "Tu as été super!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_DawnYouMetCreatorsOfSinnoh",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: So, I was thinking...\n",
        "Those Pokémon you met, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\r",
        "Were they the ones said to be the\n",
        "creators of the Sinnoh region?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: Dis, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\n",
        "Je me demandais...\r",
        "Ces Pokémon que tu as rencontrés...\n",
        "Tu crois que ce sont eux qui ont créé\f",
        "Sinnoh, comme le dit la légende?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CounterpartTalk_Text_LucasYouMetCreatorsOfSinnoh",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: So, I was thinking...\n",
        "Those Pokémon you met, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\r",
        "Were they the ones said to be the\n",
        "creators of the Sinnoh region?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: Dis, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\n",
        "Je me demandais...\r",
        "Ces Pokémon que tu as rencontrés...\n",
        "Tu crois que ce sont eux qui ont créé\f",
        "Sinnoh, comme le dit la légende?"
      ]
    }
  ]
